Package: gsm.bio
Title: Statistics for Biomarker Charts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("obot", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "obot@users.noreply.github.com")
  )
Description: The statistics behind the 'bio.viz' biomarker charts. Each
    function fixes the inputs and the shape of the answer around a test
    from the 'stats' or 'survival' package, so every number a chart prints
    is computed by R, and the same function serves a desktop session, R in
    the browser and a server.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/jwildfire/gsm.bio,
    https://jwildfire.github.io/gsm.bio/
BugReports: https://github.com/jwildfire/gsm.bio/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    survival
Suggests:
    effectsize,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
